{
  "comment": "Which incident an alert belongs to (health/incident.rs root_of). Each case names the alert, the alerts already active, and the root it must get; the cabling, models and GPU faults below are the context every case shares. Run by health/tests.rs and by the node agent (agent_test.py), so both group and title pages the same way. Cases marked macOnly are about this Mac's own path to the cluster (health/reach.rs): macReach is the snapshot's mac_reach state and unreachable the nodes timing out; the agents can't see the Mac, so agent_test.py skips them.",
  "ifaces": [
    {"node": "cell1", "iface": "enp1s0f1np1", "ip": "192.168.100.1", "switchPort": "crs804/qsfp56-dd-1-1"},
